@startuml sequence_remove
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title ag-grid Removal - Sequence

actor Developer
participant "rg pre-flight" as RG
participant "Workspace" as WS
participant "npm" as NPM
participant "Jest" as J
participant "ng build" as B

Developer -> RG: rg -n 'ag-grid|AgGrid|ICellRendererAngularComp'
RG --> Developer: 0 matches (pass)
Developer -> WS: rm components/{edit,delete,checkbox,star}-cell
Developer -> WS: edit package.json (drop two deps)
Developer -> NPM: npm install
NPM --> WS: regenerate package-lock.json
Developer -> WS: edit styles.scss (drop two @import)
Developer -> WS: add ag-grid-removal.spec.ts
Developer -> J: npm test
J --> Developer: green
Developer -> B: npm run build
B --> Developer: green
Developer -> Developer: open PR (gated on 18-23 merged)

@enduml
